{
  "_id": "XvZICR4xANTBWKpU",
  "name": "命运修枝剪 Fate Cutter Shears (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "61",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（匕首），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>该修枝剪的刀口上带有许多刻痕与凹痕，但依旧能干净利落地修剪。这把剪刀可以如一把魔法匕首被使用，且该武器拥有以下特性：</p><h3>永远锋利Ever Sharp。</h3><p> 当你使用该剪刀进行的攻击命中时，目标受到额外[[/damage 1d6 type=force]]伤害。</p><h3>断丝命剪Sever Threads。</h3><p> 当你使用该剪刀命中一个生物时，你便可以裁剪该生物的命运。直到目标进行一次长休之前，任何针对其的[[/r d20]]攻击检定在骰出19或20时即为暴击。一旦使用了该特性后，直到第二天黎明之前你无法再次使用该特性。</p><p>The blades of these pruning shears bear many nicks and dents but still cut cleanly. The shears function as a magic dagger. The weapon has the following properties:</p><ul><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Ever Sharp\"><span class=\"bold\">Ever Sharp.</span> When you hit with an attack using the shears, the target takes an extra [[/damage 1d6 type=force]] damage.</p></li><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Sever Threads\"><span class=\"bold\">Sever Threads.</span> When you hit a creature with the shears, you can cut that creature's fate. Until the target finishes a long rest, attack rolls against it score a critical hit on a roll of 19 or 20 on the [[/r d20]]. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
